  "properties": {
    "title": "Forecasting Flash Floods in Seoul Using Tiny Radars without FOSS4G in the Operational Phase",
    "description": "Seoul experiences concentrated rainfall. Our team is trying to mitigate the flooding by using tiny radars. During the development phase, our software architecture relied heavily on FOSS4G. However, for the operational phase, we have removed our dependency on FOSS4G. We have found that this approach is more suitable.\n\n.",
